   VIRTUAL_HANDLING_UNIT_CD            VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT 'A code that shows for what reason the virtual handling unit has to be created.The virtual handling unit is almost always used temporarily to indicate handling unit availability. A few examples for the code; A = Dummy Handling Unit für Lokation, B = Geplante Handling Unit, P = Dummy Handling Unit für Pending Differences. Same for all stock items transported on a handling unit with the same handling log id.',
   HANDLING_UNIT_TYPE_CD               VARCHAR(10)     COMMENT 'The code shows the type of the Handling Unit e.g. a pallete, a carton etc. Same for all stock items transported on a handling unit with the same handling log id.',
